        "id": "https://openalex.org/W7202086526",
        "doi": "10.1007/s00603-026-05601-0",
        "title": "Combined Effect of Porosity and Pore-Size Heterogeneity on Young’s Modulus of Chemically Corroded Rocks",
        "published": "2026-08-10",
        "url": "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00603-026-05601-0",
        "authors": [
          "Hao Li",
          "Zhenjiang You",
